  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 718f67b7b841dde4a89478ad5ef11627, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Ch2_2_Siobhan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Zmywak.Narrative::Zmywak.Narrative.Dialogue.DialogueGraph
  startNodeId: sio_1
  nodes:
  - nodeId: sio_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Sobota, wiecz\xF3r, pe\u0142na sala. Przez okienko podawcze co chwil\u0119 wpada g\u0142owa w rudych lokach i wo\u0142a zam\xF3wienia szybciej, ni\u017C Kuba je rozumie."
    - speakerId: siobhan
      language: 1
      text: Two plates for table four, and where's the jacks key? Some eejit locked it again!
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "\"Jacks\". Nie mam poj\u0119cia, co to jest. Ale mina m\xF3wi, \u017Ce co\u015B pilnego."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - table
    - key
    - locked
    - again
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Podaj\u0119 jej klucz z haczyka nad zlewem."
      targetNodeId: sio_key
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: Pytam, co to jest "jacks".
      targetNodeId: sio_ask
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: sio_key
    lines:
    - speakerId: siobhan
      language: 1
      text: Ah, you're a star! The jacks is the toilet, by the way. You'll learn.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Strza\u0142 w ciemno. Trafiony. Filozofia nazywa to intuicj\u0105, ja nazywam to haczykiem z napisem WC."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - star
    - toilet
    - learn
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_jacks
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 5
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: sio_invite
  - nodeId: sio_ask
    lines:
    - speakerId: siobhan
      language: 1
      text: The jacks? The toilet, pet! And an eejit is... well, whoever locked it. Not you, I hope.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Dwa s\u0142owa w jednym zdaniu. Agnieszka b\u0119dzie zazdrosna, \u017Ce ucz\u0119 si\u0119 szybciej w kuchni ni\u017C ona na kursie."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - toilet
    - hope
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_jacks
    - slang_eejit
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 5
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: sio_invite
  - nodeId: sio_invite
    lines:
    - speakerId: siobhan
      language: 1
      text: Mondays are dead, so after close on Monday we're all going to Mulligan's. The whole kitchen. You coming?
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "W poniedzia\u0142ek po zamkni\u0119ciu do pubu. Ca\u0142a kuchnia. W kopercie zosta\u0142o, ile zosta\u0142o."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - dead
    - going
    - close
    - whole
    - coming
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Id\u0119. Raz si\u0119 \u017Cyje."
      targetNodeId: sio_yes
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Wymiguj\u0119 si\u0119. Musz\u0119 si\u0119 wyspa\u0107."
      targetNodeId: sio_no
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: sio_yes
    lines:
    - speakerId: siobhan
      language: 1
      text: Deadly! Bring your wallet, it's your round after mine.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - wallet
    - round
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_deadly
    setFlags:
    - ch2_pub_yes
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: sio_end
  - nodeId: sio_no
    lines:
    - speakerId: siobhan
      language: 1
      text: Ah, you're no craic at all. Next time, so.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - time
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch2_pub_no
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: sio_end
  - nodeId: sio_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "W szkole uczyli mnie \"How do you do\". Nikt tu tak nie m\xF3wi. Tu m\xF3wi si\u0119 \"what's the craic\" i \"you're a star\". Podr\u0119czniki k\u0142ama\u0142y."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
